WEBVTT

00:54:28.233 --> 00:54:30.071
I would emphasize the word "apparent."

00:54:30.095 --> 00:54:33.158
The 70% rise in teenage suicide rate

00:54:33.182 --> 00:54:35.795
correlates pretty well
with the rise of the smartphone.

00:54:35.819 --> 00:54:37.478
And so it's an apparent community,

00:54:37.502 --> 00:54:40.355
but it's also a community
that can be comparative

00:54:40.379 --> 00:54:42.847
and doesn't really satisfy people.

00:54:42.871 --> 00:54:45.598
So -- this is something you appreciate

00:54:45.622 --> 00:54:48.066
probably more than any other
human being on earth --

00:54:48.090 --> 00:54:51.407
we have, now, all these screens,
we can sit at home and watch YouTube.

00:54:51.431 --> 00:54:54.548
So what's taken off in the last 10 years?
The conference business.

00:54:54.572 --> 00:54:55.880
People want to be together.

00:54:55.904 --> 00:54:59.503
They want to be in a room together
and experience something face-to-face,

00:54:59.527 --> 00:55:02.273
body-to-body and emotion-to-emotion.